      "widgets_values": [
        "## Lyrics Transcription (HeartMuLa)\n\nNodes: [BobRandomNumber/ComfyUI-HeartMuLa](https://github.com/BobRandomNumber/ComfyUI-HeartMuLa). Model: [HeartMuLa/HeartTranscriptor-oss](https://huggingface.co/HeartMuLa/HeartTranscriptor-oss), a Whisper-based transcriber trained on sung vocals rather than speech.\n\n```dotenv\nCOMFY_ASSET_PROFILES=heartmula-transcribe\n```\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/models/HeartMuLa/\n└── 📂 HeartTranscriptor-oss/     ← 2.9 GB\n```\n\n**Drop your own audio into `ComfyUI/input/` first** and pick it in Load Audio — the repo ships no sample track, which is also why this template has no smoke lane.\n\n### Settings\n\n- `temperature` 0.0 turns on multi-temperature fallback decoding, which is the robust setting for music; a non-zero value pins it to that single temperature.\n- `num_beams` 2 is a reasonable quality/speed point; 1 is greedy and much faster.\n- `condition_on_prev_tokens` helps long-form continuity but lets an early mistake propagate through the rest of the track.\n- `no_speech_threshold` 0.4 decides what counts as an instrumental passage. Raise it if instrumental breaks come back as hallucinated words.\n\nPair it with **Text to Music (HeartMuLa 3B)**: transcribe a reference track, edit the lyrics, then regenerate."
      ],
      "title": "Credit, model and settings",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
